      "title": "Bugfix: restrict adwin-configuration dissector to udp port 7000",
      "message": "Bugfix: restrict adwin-configuration dissector to udp port 7000\n\nAs discussed in [1], both the tcp and udp dissectors should only decode packets with port 7000.\n\n[1]\nhttps://ask.wireshark.org/question/34587/i-am-generating-a-udp-packet-the-data-payload-is-interpreted-by-wireshark-as-a-adwin_config-message-what-determines-an-adwin_config-message/\n",
